    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>The Geth Pulse Rifle fires streams of superheated plasma slugs generated by an internal mass effect field accelerator. Unlike conventional kinetic weapons, it delivers electricity-based damage that arcs unpredictably on impact and proves particularly effective against shielded targets. Recovered units require adaptation for organic use but reward the effort with exceptional range and fire rate.</p>"
